Package: ResearchDesigns
Title: A Library of Declared Designs
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Macartan", "Humphreys",
                  email = "macartan.humphreys@wzb.eu",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A lightweight library of research designs declared with
    DeclareDesign. Designs live as self-contained R files; editable
    parameters are read from the design itself. Optional YAML metadata
    adds labels, categories, tips, and book aliases. Includes maintainer
    tools to index, audit, and bake small diagnosis previews, plus a
    bundled Shiny browser (`run_shiny()`).
